/*
 * The level data that isn't in the ROM: the rooms in levels.json's "rooms"
 * that no ROM region lists (their room data and assets) and the BG tile
 * sets that only they use. With the original data there are none, so this
 * object is empty and the ROM matches. ldscript.txt links it after the
 * IWRAM image, into the cartridge's 0xFF fill, so nothing of the ROM
 * moves; past the fill, rom_fill's ALIGN(0x800000) grows the ROM.
 *
 * The definitions are generated by tools/levels.py appended from
 * data/levels/ (docs/levels.md, "Adding a room").
 */
